60x1440.png", "id": "1797218425737389", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908835808_1797218429070722_8264862225625725446_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SADKglnlwAcQ7kNvwGBBk0a&_nc_oc=AdoiM-jrslkHcnouVgbQu6JARg4mmGEvzQdZh6o6jebctrtCc0mVqZqu2JfmYyPRLRA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQavLmcnS_-A16CPoHj_6-iTkSHV3-Vea-S4SzvM0YVvg&oe=6B0C83CF"}, "display_name": "TrueScale", "keywords": ["Printing", "3D", "CAD", "STL", "prototyping"], "long_description": "**Stop guessing. See it at real size.**\n\nWill the case fit the board? Is the part too big for the shelf? TrueScale puts your 3D models in your room at true 1:1 scale, so you know before you print, cut or order.\n\n**From your computer to your desk**\nDrop STL, 3MF, OBJ or glTF files into any browser on your Wi-Fi network and the model appears in front of you, at real size. No sign-up, no cloud, nothing to install.\n\n**Built for makers, designers and engineers**\n- **Hold it in your hands.** Grab, turn and place models with your hands or controllers.\n- **Measure anything:** edges, faces, holes, even the gap between two parts.\n- **Look inside** with section planes and CAD-style hatching.\n- **Work on real surfaces:** turn any table or wall into a graduated cutting mat with grid, protractor and snapping down to 0.1 mm.\n- **Test the fit for real:** exact collisions let a 20 mm pin slide into a 20 mm hole, while a 22 mm one stops on the rim.\n- **Pick up where you left off:** saved scenes come back to the same spot on your desk.\n\n**It feels like it's really there**\nReal objects and your own hands appear in front of the models, so every part sits naturally in your room.\n\nMade for Meta Quest 3 and 3S. Your computer and headset need to be on the same trusted Wi-Fi network.", "short_description": "See your 3D models at real size, right in your room. TrueScale places STL, 3MF, OBJ and glTF files in mixed reality at 1:1 scale, sent straight from your PC's browser over Wi-Fi. Measure them, cut them with section planes, lay them on graduated cutting mats and check how parts fit together before you print or build."}]}, "developer_name": "nullByte", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nullbyte-site.web.app/html/privacy/truescale.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "nullByte", "support_website_url": "https://nullbyte-site.web.app/html/support/truescale.html", "website_url": "https://nullbyte-site.web.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1063584910766706"}, {"id": "393222478507326"}, {"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1869881591033083"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4939744156253123"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "4939744156253123"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1795437000, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4939744156253123"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1871862434168332", "version": "1.0.0"}, "id": "962606759970739", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1869881584366417", "is_